        "content": "<p>I think it makes sense to refactor the 1-variation file, similar to how it is done for <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/MeasureTheory/Function/LpSeminorm/Defs.html#MeasureTheory.eLpNorm'\">MeasureTheory.eLpNorm'</a>.</p>",
